{"title":"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> below with the number you receive.\n</p><p>Safiya started a run at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/6/3b64e1157333c0621c34cc140e687bc3f4f3a1a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1:40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> p.m. and finished at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/c/51c59528631770bd8abef674846e31b37cbb9713.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2:30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> p.m. She ran with her friend for the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, then ran alone for the remaining time. How many minutes did she spend running alone?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/6/3b64e1157333c0621c34cc140e687bc3f4f3a1a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1:40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> p.m. would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/c/51c59528631770bd8abef674846e31b37cbb9713.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2:30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> p.m, so she ran for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes in total.\n</p><p>Because she ran with her friend for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, she ran for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/6/3f6f78863c0b86c8e3a233d3aa8299e6f3771fda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50 - N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" /> minutes alone.\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1\">player 1</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/8/438df963824c363b8cd1013056baadf5cc330d25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>This means that she ran for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/9/67959b6d1fca7e82584f92dafc08f503c07955e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50 - 26 = \\boxed{24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"114\" height=\"25\" /> minutes alone.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC\">2024 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 1\">Relay A Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 3\">Relay A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 7 (page does not e